e":"Answer","text":"Official Try family domains are tryquickimg.com, trydevsnip.com, and trycalculatingnow.com. Each hosts that product directly (http→https and www→apex only). They are not affiliated with lookalike brands that omit the “Try” prefix — including quickimg.org / quickimg.io, DevSnips (devsnips.biz) / DevSnip Pro, CalcNest (calcnest.com) / Calculators Nest, or calculatesnow.com — and they do not redirect to those sites. TryQuickImg is also not Quinn / TryQuinn (tryquinn.com), an audio-stories app that Google sometimes shows for the query tryquickimg. TryTokka is not TikTok, not ToreTokka, not the Tokka video-chat app, and not Tokka Labs (tokkalabs.com, crypto trading). Product names always include “Try”."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Acsaven?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Acsaven is the parent brand behind the Try family. Free-hosted hub: https://acsaven.com/. Canonical products live on .com — trytokka.com and the sister utility .com sites. The Acsaven parent hub is attribution only, not where product traffic should go."}}]}</script><main class="flex-1 content-app pt-12 sm:pt-16 pb-16"><h1 class="font-display text-display-lg font-bold">Samson PG</h1><p class="mt-2 text-lg text-text-muted">Maker of <!-- -->TryTokka</p><aside id="quick-answer" class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-rim)] bg-[var(--color-surface-2)] p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)]" aria-label="Quick answer"><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-brand)]">Quick answer</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-[var(--color-text)]">Samson PG is the independent founder of TryTokka (trytokka.com) — an AI API cost monitor with Scout spend alerts — under the Acsaven parent brand (https://acsaven.com/), alongside free privacy-first browser tools on their official .com sites (TryQuickImg, TryDevSnip, TryCalculatingNow).</p></aside><div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-base text-text-muted leading-relaxed"><p>Samson PG builds the <strong class="text-text">Try family</strong> under the<!-- --> <a href="https://acsaven.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="normal-case normal-case font-medium text-brand hover:underline underline-offset-2">Acsaven</a> parent brand: paid AI spend monitoring on<!-- --> <strong class="text-text">trytokka.com</strong>, plus free utilities that run in your browser after the page loads when a server is not required — each on its official .com domain.</p><p>TryTokka<!-- --> exists because overnight agent loops and multi-provider stacks create surprise invoices. Scout syncs daily (or when you click Sync now) and emails after the next check when you cross a limit — usually within ~24h. Keys are encrypted; prompts are never collected.</p></div><section class="mt-10" aria-labelledby="author-links"><h2 id="author-links" class="font-display text-lg font-bold mb-4">Links</h2><ul class="space-y-2 text-sm"><li><a class="text-brand hover:underline" href="/about">About TryTokka</a></li><li><a class="text-brand hover:underline" href="/try-family">Try family hub</a></li><li><a href="https://acsaven.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="normal-case text-brand hover:underline">Acsaven</a><span class="text-text-faint"> — parent brand hub (free-hosted)</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/SamsonPG" class="text-brand hover:underline" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub</a></li><li><a href="https://tryquickimg.com" class="text-brand hover:underline" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">TryQuickImg</a><span class="text-text-muted"> — <!-- -->tryquickimg.com<!-- --> · <!-- -->HEIC, compress, resize, QR</span></li><li><a href="https://trydevsnip.com" class="text-brand hover:underline" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">TryDevSnip</a><span class="text-text-muted"> — <!-- -->trydevsnip.com<!-- --> · <!-- -->JSON, timestamps, cron</span></li><li><a href="https://trycalculatingnow.com" class="text-brand hover:underline" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">TryCalculatingNow</a><span class="text-text-muted"> — <!-- -->trycalculatingnow.com<!-- --> · <!-- -->Grades, GPA, %, compound interest</span></li></ul></section><section class="mt-12 border-t border-rule pt-10" aria-labelledby="author-faq"><h2 id="author-faq" class="font-display text-display-md font-bold mb-6">Quick answers</h2><div class="space-y-3"><div class="surface-card p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-text text-sm mb-1.5">Who is Samson PG?</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">Samson PG is the independent maker of TryTokka and the broader Try family of tools under Acsaven (https://acsaven.com/) — including TryQuickImg, TryDevSnip, and TryCalculatingNow. He builds products so developers can track AI spend and keep everyday utility work private in the browser when a server is not required.</p></div><div class="surface-card p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-text text-sm mb-1.5">Does TryTokka sell or train on my prompts?</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">No. TryTokka connects to provider billing/usage endpoints only. It does not sit in the request path and does not store prompts or completions.</p></div><div class="surface-card p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-text text-sm mb-1.5">Is TryTokka affiliated with TikTok?</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">No. TryTokka is an AI API spend dashboard for developers. It is not affiliated with ByteDance, TikTok, or any social video app. It is not ToreTokka (toretokka.com), the Bangladeshi news-aggregator app, not Tokka the video-chat app, and not Tokka Labs (tokkalabs.com, crypto trading). If you searched Tryakka or tryakka, that is the same product — a misspelling of TryTokka.</p></div><div class="surface-card p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-text text-sm mb-1.5">Is TryTokka the same as ToreTokka?</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">No. TryTokka at trytokka.com monitors AI API spend. ToreTokka at toretokka.com aggregates Bangladeshi news. They are different products. The query trytokka refers to this spend dashboard.</p></div><div class="surface-card p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-text text-sm mb-1.5">Are the Try sister sites the same as Quinn, quickimg.org, DevSnips, CalcNest, or calculatesnow.com?</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">Official Try family domains are tryquickimg.com, trydevsnip.com, and trycalculatingnow.com. Each hosts that product directly (http→https and www→apex only). They are not affiliated with lookalike brands that omit the “Try” prefix — including quickimg.org / quickimg.io, DevSnips (devsnips.biz) / DevSnip Pro, CalcNest (calcnest.com) / Calculators Nest, or calculatesnow.com — and they do not redirect to those sites. TryQuickImg is also not Quinn / TryQuinn (tryquinn.com), an audio-stories app that Google sometimes shows for the query tryquickimg. TryTokka is not TikTok, not ToreTokka, not the Tokka video-chat app, and not Tokka Labs (tokkalabs.com, crypto trading). Product names always include “Try”.</p></div><div class="surface-card p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-text text-sm mb-1.5">What is Acsaven?</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">Acsaven is the parent brand behind the Try family. Free-hosted hub: https://acsaven.com/. Canonical products live on .com — trytokka.com and the sister utility .com sites. The Acsaven parent hub is attribution only, not where product traffic should go.</p></div></div></section></main><footer class="border-t border-rule py-10 pb-[calc(2.5rem+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] mt-auto bg-surface/20"><div class="content-marketing"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-8"><div class="space-y-3 max-w-sm"><a class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 rounded-xl transition-[opacity,filter,transform] hover:opacity-100 hover:brightness-110 active:scale-[0.98] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offs